config":{"mono":true,"text":"image/png","tone":"default","variant":"label"},"id":"l-a5-type","type":"Text"},{"config":{"direction":"horizontal","gap":0,"justify":"end"},"id":"l-a5-size","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"mono":true,"text":"18 kB","tone":"default","variant":"label"},"id":"l-a5-size-text","type":"Text"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"direction":"horizontal","gap":6,"wrap":true},"id":"l-a5-usage","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"icon":"circle-alert","label":{"$i18n":"assets.problems.one"},"tone":"danger","value":1,"variant":"subtle"},"id":"l-a5-problems","type":"Badge"},{"config":{"label":{"$i18n":"assets.unused"},"tone":"neutral","variant":"outline"},"id":"l-a5-unused","type":"Badge"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"direction":"horizontal","gap":0,"justify":"end"},"id":"l-a5-download","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"icon":"download","iconOnly":true,"label":{"$i18n":"assets.download"},"size":"sm","variant":"ghost"},"id":"l-a5-download-button","type":"Button"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"TableRow"}]},"type":"Table"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Assets","spec":{"accessibility":["Unused and the problem count are text badges, never color alone; each tile is one button named by the Asset, and the layout buttons have names."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Icon, Image, Badge, Button, Select, SelectOption, TextInput, Table, TableRow, EmptyState, Alert, Skeleton); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The three images are Assets of this Workspace bound by `$asset`; the usage counts and the two Assets that are only listed (a PDF and an Asset with a problem) are sample content, because usage is derived from the Views.","Every visible string of the page is bound with $i18n except Asset names, filenames, media types and sizes, which are Workspace content; the tooltips of the layout buttons are not modelled.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member opened Assets from the Workspace pages; the Assets of the Workspace are listed with their media type and size, and each Asset's usage is counted from the `$asset` bindings of the Views.","The base state is a desktop layout for a holder of assets.write: five Assets in a grid (two Views bind the first, one the second and third, the last two are unused, one of them with a problem).","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; on tablet and phone the page is read-only and says to edit on desktop, and a phone has no list layout."],"intent":"Show the Workspace Assets page as built from Adapter Widgets only: the library of images and files that Views bind, as a grid or a list, with filters for type and usage, which Assets are used, unused or have problems, and the way to upload one.","interactionRules":["A tile shows the image preview (a file icon for other files, a broken-file icon for an Asset with problems), the name, the media type and size, how many Views bind it or Unused, and a download action.","An Asset no View binds stays in the Workspace and is only marked Unused; an Asset whose files or metadata are invalid is flagged with its problem count and shows no preview, and nothing is rewritten.","Search matches name and filename; type (all, images, other files) and usage (any, used, unused) narrow the library, and a filter that matches nothing offers to clear the filters.","The layout choice (grid or list) is a convenience kept by this browser; Upload (assets.write, desktop) opens the upload dialog, and an Asset opens its detail from its tile or row."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"}],"requirements":["01a115cd-c13a-7769-b289-2e13417438e5","01a115cd-c09f-7018-9f52-48b05284f